[size=4][b]Source and permissions[/b][/size]

Source code is on GitHub: [url=https://github.com/lyova/Werewolf]github.com/lyova/Werewolf[/url]

The code and configuration are MIT licensed - fork it, modify it, bundle it into mod packs; credit is appreciated but not required. [b]The artwork in Resources\ is not mine to relicense[/b]: it is licensed from Fab for use in this mod and may not be extracted or reused.
